WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.020 --> 00:00:02.770 align:start position:0%
 
[Applause]  Shawn Mendes is opening up about his  time with Haley Baldwin the  twenty-year-old musician attended this  year's Met Gala with a 22 year old model  and rumors swirled that the pair were  dating month later she was engaged to  Justin Bieber at the time Mendes told ET  that they were just friends  no we're not dating but it was it was so  fun dude it was it was honestly just  such an honor to be there and Haley is  one of the coolest and most special  people I've ever met and to be able to  walk with her because she's such a vet  she's done it for four years made the  pressure feels so much less on me and I  just really enjoy myself but in a new  interview with Rolling Stone he admits  that they were a bit more than that  quote I don't even want to put a title  on it I think it was more of a zone of  limbo she later unfollowed the stiches  singer on Instagram and is now married  to Bieber Mendez told the mag quote I  texted Haley congratulations and I  really am happy for them she's still one  of the coolest people ever she's not  just a beautiful person visually but  she's one of the most beautiful hearts  I've ever met the heartthrobs love life  has been an ongoing topic in the press  especially from those fans who like to  speculate about his sexuality something  that Mendez says has given him lots of  anxiety quote in the back of my heart I  feel like I need to go be seen with  someone like a girl in public to prove  to people that I'm not gay even though  in my heart I know that it's not a bad  thing there's still a piece of me that  thinks that and I hate that side of me  he also recalls this video that his  friend Taylor Swift posted of him  wearing sparkly eyeshadow  saying he woke up in a panic after  giving her permission to share it quote  I felt sick I was like why did I let her  post that I just fed the fire that I'm  terrified of anxiety is is not a myth  and everybody has their own version of  it and their own reasons for having it  he continued explaining why he's annoyed  by the constant questioning I thought  you guys are so lucky I'm not actually  gay and terrified of coming out that's  something that kills people  that's how sensitive it is do you like  the songs do you like me who cares if  I'm gay and while the pop star got  candid in the Rolling Stone article he  tweeted that he wasn't exactly pleased  with it writing of course I have my  insecurities and struggles but that's  just one part of me sometimes the  positive side of a story doesn't always  get fully told and I wish it had here  Mendez opened up to ET in May about his  battle with anxiety which inspired his  hit single in my blood the song is about  overcoming the feeling it's about  experiencing the feeling and how the  world crashes down around you but over  how you can always overcome that how is  the Shawn Mendes today that we see now  different from the guy that we first met  I'm not as worried about what people  think as much and that shows a lot in  the music  [Music]

